--[[
    Level 9 - Windworks
    An old air factory. Fans decide everything: vents (F) lift a Small ball
    high, a Normal ball a little, and a Big ball not at all. Blowers (<)
    push a Small ball away while a Big ball rolls right through.

    1. warm-up hall: first vent, a ledge only Small can float to
    2. fan bridge: shrink and float over a spike pit on vent pairs
    3. wind tunnel: grow Big to push through, drop down the hole at the end
    4. the tall shaft: float up ledge by ledge, then on/off vents (U / V),
       the key waits at the top
    5. on/off pit: hop from vent pair to vent pair as they take turns
    6. smash finish: float over the wall into the box, grow Big, smash
       the cracked floor, fall to the locked door and the flag

    Legend:  . empty   # ground   = steel   C cracked   ^ spikes
             P pump    * gem      E spark bot  B drone  S start   G goal
             H checkpoint  K key  D locked door
             F vent    U / V on/off vents (take turns)   < blower (blows left)
]]

